OL,3,AUS consortium wins huge Kenya mining   
OL,4,Adeal, beating Chinese rivals           
OL,6,FA US-led consortium, Frontier Minerals,
OL,7,Fhas won the tender to develop Kenya's  
OL,8,FMrima Hill mining project, beating     
OL,9,Fseven bidders, including companies from
OL,10,FChina and Australia.                   
OL,12,FThe site is estimated to hold deposits 
OL,13,Fof critical minerals worth more than   
OL,14,F$60bn (#45bn), including niobium, used 
OL,15,Fin electric vehicles, aerospace and    
OL,16,Fdefence technology.                    
OL,18,FFrontier Minerals says its proposal    
OL,19,Faims to keep more of the economic      
OL,20,Fbenefits in Kenya through "processing  
OL,21,Fand refining of minerals in-country".  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
